							{
								"definition": {
									"fragment": {
										"key": "BASIC_COMPONENT-html"
									},
									"fragmentConfig": {
									},
									"fragmentFields": [
										{
											"id": "element-html",
											"value": {
												"html": {
													"value_i18n": {
														"en_US": "<div class=\"f-text font-size-paragraph-base\"><style>\n\t.company-description-container {\n\t\twidth: 846px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-description-icons-container {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\tborder: solid 1.5px #E2E2E4;\n\t\twidth: 846px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-icon {\n\t\theight: 48px;\n\t\twidth: 48px;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-inner {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\theight: 353px;\n\t\toverflow: hidden;\n\t\twidth: 682.99px;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-next, .carousel-control-prev {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\ttransition: all .3s ease-in-out;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-next:hover, .carousel-control-prev:hover {\n\t\tbackground: rgb(0, 0, 0);\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-prev:hover {\n\t\tbackground: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 90%);\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\ttransition: all .3s ease-in-out;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-next:hover {\n\t\tbackground: linear-gradient(-90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 90%);\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\ttransition: all .3s ease-in-out;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-indicators li {\n\t\tborder-radius: 50%;\n\t\tborder: solid 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5) !important;\n\t\theight: 10px !important;\n\t\twidth: 10px !important;\n\t}\n</style>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t<div class=\"block-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"block-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center container d-flex flex-column\">\n\t<div>\n\t\t<h2>\n\t\t\tCore Features of Liferay DXP E-Learning Solution\n\t\t</h2>\n\n\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t</p><h2>Course Catalog Management</h2><p>Smart, card-based course discovery for easy browsing.&nbsp;</p><h2>Enrollment Workflow</h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Seamless course&nbsp;enrollment&nbsp;with approval process</span>.</p><h2>Learning Dashboard</h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Personalized dashboard to track courses and Learning progress</span>.&nbsp;</p><h2>Quiz <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">&amp; Assessment</span></h2><p>A<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Configurable quizzes for continuous learning evaluation.&nbsp;</span></p><h2>Certificate <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Generation</span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Automated certificates upon course completion.&nbsp;</span></p><h2>Administration <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">&amp; Course Management</span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Centralized course management with real-time learner progress and completion analytics.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t\t<p></p>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"block-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"block-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center container d-flex flex-column\">\n\t<div>\n\t\t<h2>\n\t\t\tKey Features of Liferay DXP E-Learning Solution by Surekha Technologies\n\t\t</h2>\n\n\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t</p><h2><strong>Liferay DXP Aligned Architecture</strong></h2><p>Utilized Liferay's built-in features Solution built around using Objects, Workflows, Fragments, Collection Display, and Display Page Templates to minimize deep customization and accelerate development.</p><h2><strong>Object Modeling</strong></h2><p>Used Liferay Objects to manage core entities including Course, Topic, Quiz, Enrollment - with relationships and Headless REST APIs auto-generated out of the box.</p><h2><strong>Interactive Components</strong></h2><p>Implemented dynamic and interactive UI components such as Course Detail, Enrollment Form, Quiz, Progress Tracker, and Certificate Viewer using React Client Extensions embedded as Custom Elements within Liferay Content Pages.</p><h2><strong>Enrollment Automation</strong></h2><p>Automated Liferay user account creation and credentials email delivery on enrollment approval using a Groovy script, eliminating manual admin intervention.</p><h2><strong>Course Builder</strong></h2><p>Admin can create and manage courses including topics and quizzes through a dedicated React-based Course Builder interface.</p><h2><strong>Progress Monitoring</strong></h2><p>Admin can monitor enrolled users per course, track individual progress percentages, and download completion certificates directly from the enrollment management interface.</p><h2><strong>Auto Completion</strong></h2><p>Topics are automatically marked as completed when the user navigates to the next topic, removing the need for manual checkbox interaction.</p><h2><strong>Resume Learning</strong></h2><p>Course consumption supports resume functionality, allowing users to continue from the exact topic where they previously left off.</p><h2><strong>Quiz Management</strong></h2><p>Supports course-level quizzes and exams with configurable assessment flows for evaluating learner progress and understanding.</p><h2><strong>Certificate Assignment</strong></h2><p>Automatically assigns and generates completion certificates for users upon successful course completion.</p>\n\t\t<p></p>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div></div>"
													}
												}
											}
										}
									],
									"indexed": true
