														"en_US": "<div class=\"f-text font-size-paragraph-base\"><style>\n\t.catalog-icon {\n\t\twidth: 90px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-description-container {\n\t\twidth: 846px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-description-icons-container {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\tborder: solid 1.5px #E2E2E4;\n\t\twidth: 846px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-icon {\n\t\theight: 48px;\n\t\twidth: 48px;\n\t}\n</style>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t<div class=\"block-container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center container d-flex flex-column\">\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"Slide 0\" class=\"catalog-icon mb-8\" src=\"[$DOCUMENT_URL:/site-initializer/documents/group/solutions/e-learning-portal/007.png$]\">\n\n\t\t\t<h1 class=\"mb-6\">\n\t\t\t\tSurekha Technologies\n\t\t\t</h1>\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"company-description-container mb-6\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Surekha Technologies</strong> is <strong>a veteran, Certified Liferay Partner</strong> with a proven track record of delivering innovative, <strong>enterprise-grade solutions for global clients</strong> across the USA, Europe, the Middle East, and the APAC region.</p><p><br></p><p>As a specialized Liferay agency, we combine <strong>deep technical and functional expertise</strong> to empower businesses through <strong>AI-supported development, seamless migrations to Liferay, and upgrades to the latest Liferay versions</strong>.</p><p><br></p><p>From <strong>architecting high-performance environments</strong> to <strong>ensuring quality through automated QA</strong> and <strong>team alignment</strong>, we provide <strong>end-to-end consulting to maximize the value of your Liferay investment</strong>.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"bg-white company-description-icons-container d-flex justify-content-between px-8 py-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center d-flex mr-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"company-icon\" aria-label=\"video-thumbnail\" src=\"[$DOCUMENT_URL:/site-initializer/documents/group/solutions